# Syndicate War — PREVIEW output only.
# fetch-syndicate.js quarantines provisional runs (season not open, modelled
# window, every conduct term zero) into a preview/ folder. bureau-data is served
# straight off the site, so committing these would publish scores that are not
# canon. Real season output sits beside it and IS tracked.
public/bureau-data/syndicate/*/preview/

